  {"id": 1, "title": "Supply lines", "briefing": ["A bigger map means more orders. A forwarding rule gives them for you.", "In the send popup, the Forward tab turns a send into a standing rule: every turn, that system passes its new ships down the lane.", "Route plans many routes at once. Pick one or more 'rallying points', and every system forwards toward them.", "Point the back of your empire at the front and spend your orders on the fighting."], "hint": "Forward tab: a standing rule. Route: forward a whole group to one place.",
