  {"id": 2, "title": "Crossing in flight", "briefing": ["The number on each lane is how many turns it takes to travel. Ships are slow here.", "Ships you send leave home at once, and fight when they arrive. Fleets in flight don't interact.", "This rival rushes. Send everything away and it will walk into the system you left empty.", "Keep a guard at home, and count the turns before you commit."], "hint": "Lane numbers are turns to travel. Ships in flight don't fight.",
