  {"id": 3, "title": "Defender's edge", "briefing": ["On this map, defenders have a slight advantage, so equal numbers are not enough.", "The send popup shows your odds as you pick a count, and how many ships make a capture sure. There's a more detailed breakdown if you select the odds row.", "New ships are created before fleets arrive, so count the turns until you arrive.", "The more you outnumber the enemy, the fewer you lose, but the sooner you capture, the more you can produce"], "hint": "Defenders have the edge: attack with a margin. The menu's Combat tab shows the specific parameters.",
