  {"id": 5, "title": "Three's a crowd", "briefing": ["Two rivals now, and no teams: they fight each other as well as you.", "You start in the middle, between them. Don't get stuck there, or you'll be fighting on two fronts at once.", "Tap the player names in the header to see which strategy is playing each seat and adjust your tactics accordingly.", "When several sides land on one system in the same turn, the attackers fight each other first and the survivor meets the garrison."], "hint": "You're in the middle. Push one way, guard the other, don't let them gang up on you.",
