  {"id": 6, "title": "Full house", "briefing": ["Five sides on a large map. Playing your opponents off against each other will be necessary.", "Hold your borders with forwarding rules and pick one enemy off at a time.", "The top bar shows every side's systems, ships and production. Watch who is likely to be a threat later."], "hint": "Use what you've learned to come out on top of the chaos.",
