  {"id": 8, "title": "Marshal", "briefing": ["Marshal is one of the strongest bots in the game. It reads the whole board and moves ships to where the fighting will be.", "It is patient. Expect it to strike when you are spread out, and to hold what it takes.", "Get ahead on production early, and use every trap and trick you can to trade ships favourably."], "hint": "Marshal waits for you to spread thin. Grow early, keep your front strong.",
