  {"id": 9, "title": "The hunt", "briefing": ["The last stage: actuary at its strongest style, Hunt.", "Hunt looks ahead at the strikes you could launch and guards only against those. It wastes very little.", "Win this and you have beaten one of the best bots on the board. Post your score."], "hint": "Actuary at Hunt guards against what you can reach. Threaten two places at once.",
